  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/03/IMG_4113.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La segunda edici&oacute;n de la Fiesta Latina DELUXE en GROW Club Events ha sido todo un &eacute;xito. Despu&eacute;s de la cena y la calse de baile, la velada se ha aprovechado tambi&eacute;n para entregar los diplomas a las pe&ntilde;as ganadoras del concurso de disfraces de Carnaval.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festadeluxe010314growdiplomesdisfresses/img_4103.jpg\" alt=\"img_4103\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festadeluxe010314growdiplomesdisfresses/img_4104.jpg\" alt=\"img_4104\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festadeluxe010314growdiplomesdisfresses/img_4108.jpg\" alt=\"img_4108\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festadeluxe010314growdiplomesdisfresses/img_4109.jpg\" alt=\"img_4109\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festadeluxe010314growdiplomesdisfresses/img_4110.jpg\" alt=\"img_4110\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festadeluxe010314growdiplomesdisfresses/img_4111.jpg\" alt=\"img_4111\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festadeluxe010314growdiplomesdisfresses/img_4112.jpg\" alt=\"img_4112\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/festadeluxe010314growdiplomesdisfresses/img_4113.jpg\" alt=\"img_4113\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2